WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
A good idea is not context-free. Test whether an intervention fits a different place.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Define the intervention and outcome.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Compare people, place and authority.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Test workforce and infrastructure.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Preserve nonnegotiable limits.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Adapt the model before importing it.
